 "description": "Requires a ChainHelix API key as bearer token, or 2 cents per call paid over Binance b402 in USDT, USDC, USD1 or U on BNB Smart Chain, or over x402 in USDC on the Base network. Stablecoin mints and burns of 10,000 USD or more per chain and coin over a window: counts, total dollars, large events, and the net of mints minus burns. Coins recorded since 2026-09-30T03:30Z: ethereum USDT, USDC, USD1, USDS; bnb USDT, USDC, USD1, U; polygon USDT, USDC, USDC.e; avalanche USDT, USDC; solana USDC, USDT; tron USDT. Every recorded coin is answered, with zeros when it had no mint or burn in the window. DAI and PYUSD are not recorded after 2026-09-30T03:30Z. window in hours, default 24, max 720. Omit chain for all six chains",
